  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ray of light is incident on the flat side of a semi-circular glass block placed in paraffin. The ray is totally internally reflected inside the glass block as shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The refractive index of glass is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n_{1}\"></span> and the refractive index of paraffin is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n_{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is correct?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin \\theta=\\frac{n_{1}}{n_{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin \\theta=\\frac{n_{2}}{n_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin \\theta=\\frac{1}{n_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin \\theta=\\frac{1}{n_{2}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
